WEBVTT

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:07.070 line:6% position:50% align:center
ili nisije nikaipiga dunia
kwa laana.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.500 line:6% position:50% align:center
Haya ndiyo maneno ya mwisho ya Agano la Kale.

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:19.000 line:6% position:50% align:center
Katika Biblia, ni ukurasa mmoja tu hadi kitabu kinachofuata.
Lakini katika miaka 400 iliyo katikati,
hakuna neno jipya lililosikika kutoka mbinguni.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.531 line:6% position:50% align:center
Watu walingoja.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.901 line:6% position:50% align:center
ijapokawia, ingojee

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.817 line:6% position:50% align:center
Lakini Mungu hakuacha kutenda kazi.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:40.400 line:6% position:50% align:center
Na sanamu hii kichwa chake kilikuwa ni cha dhahabu safi; kifua chake na mikono yake ni ya fedha;
tumbo lake na viuno vyake ni vya shaba; miguu yake ni ya chuma;
na nyayo za miguu yake nusu ya chuma na nusu ya udongo.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.840 line:6% position:50% align:center
Madini haya yaliashiria falme
ambazo zingeinuka moja baada ya nyingine.

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:49.680 line:6% position:50% align:center
Katika miaka hiyo 400,
Mungu aliuandaa ulimwengu hatua kwa hatua.

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:54.028 line:6% position:50% align:center
Popote Wayahudi waliotawanyika walipokwenda,
walilibeba Neno pamoja nao,

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:59.900 line:6% position:50% align:center
Baada ya Aleksanda, ulimwengu mpana
uliweza kuwasiliana kwa lugha moja: Kiyunani.

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:04.850 line:6% position:50% align:center
Maandiko yalitafsiriwa katika lugha hiyo,
na hata watu wa Mataifa wakaweza kuyasoma,

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:09.163 line:6% position:50% align:center
Roma ilifungua barabara na njia za baharini
hadi kila pembe ya milki yake.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:14.173 line:6% position:50% align:center
Katika masinagogi kote katika milki hiyo,
Neno lilisomwa kila sabato.

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:16.711 line:6% position:50% align:center
Hivyo ndivyo Mungu alivyoiandaa njia.

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:23.428 line:6% position:50% align:center
mkeo Elisabeti atakuzalia mtoto wa kiume,
na jina lake utamwita Yohana.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:26.850 line:6% position:50% align:center
Angalieni, nitawatumia Eliya nabii,

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:30.234 line:6% position:50% align:center
Naye ataigeuza mioyo ya baba iwaelekee watoto wao,

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:38.590 line:6% position:50% align:center
katika roho ya Eliya, na nguvu zake,
ili kuigeuza mioyo ya baba iwaelekee watoto,

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:45.145 line:6% position:50% align:center
Baada ya miaka 400, Mungu alisema tena.
Yule ambaye angekuja kama Eliya: Yohana Mbatizaji.

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:57.440 line:6% position:50% align:center
jiwe likachongwa bila kazi ya mikono,
nalo jiwe hilo likaipiga sanamu miguu yake,
iliyokuwa ya chuma na udongo, likaivunja vipande vipande.

00:01:57.490 --> 00:02:01.380 line:6% position:50% align:center
Lakini ulipowadia utimilifu wa wakati,
Mungu alimtuma Mwanawe

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:05.500 line:6% position:50% align:center
Lile jiwe alilolituma Mungu:
Mwanawe, Yesu, alikuja.

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:09.302 line:6% position:50% align:center
Kwa kuwa Mwana wa Adamu alikuja
kutafuta na kuokoa kile kilichopotea.

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:17.359 line:6% position:50% align:center
Katika sinagogi la mji wa kwao,
Yesu alikifungua kitabu cha nabii Isaya,
kilichoandikwa takriban miaka 700 kabla ya wakati wake.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:26.641 line:6% position:50% align:center
Leo maandiko haya yametimia masikioni mwenu.

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:31.456 line:6% position:50% align:center
Yule aliyeahidiwa takriban miaka 700 kabla yake
alikuwa ni Yesu mwenyewe.

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:36.220 line:6% position:50% align:center
Yesu alikufa msalabani kwa ajili ya dhambi zetu,
akafufuka siku ya tatu.

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:43.226 line:6% position:50% align:center
Mtume Paulo, akifuata njia hizo,
aliihubiri Injili kwa Kiyunani,
akianzia katika masinagogi.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:52.611 line:6% position:50% align:center
Mungu alikuwa akitenda kazi hata alipokuwa kimya.
Na sasa, anatenda kazi hata katika kungoja kwako.
